  "caption_latex": "Additional implementation checks. {(a)} $10^3\\operatorname{Re}\\langle a_1^\\dagger a_3\\rangle$ in the complex three-mode loop for physical drift $W$ and the changed-flux drift $W^T$. {(b):} The corresponding $10^4\\operatorname{Im}\\langle a_1^\\dagger a_3\\rangle$. In {(a,b)}, solid curves are independent cavity references; open markers and one-standard-error bars are nonlinear HOPS, with 1,024 paths for $W$ and 512 for $W^T$; some bars are smaller than the markers. {(c,d)} use $N=20$ and $J_b=+2J$. {(c):} The single-trajectory contribution $q_{xy,\\mathrm{stag}}^{(11)}(r=5)$ to {the symmetry-averaged exchange-chain estimator}, comparing $J\\Delta t=0.0025$ and 0.00125 on shared noise anchors. {(d):} The analogous transverse-XXZ contribution $q_{yy}^{(11)}(r=3)$ for the same two resolutions. Exact ensemble symmetries make the corresponding disconnected terms vanish, but {(c,d)} are individual-trajectory contributions, not ensemble correlator estimates, and have no ensemble error bars.",
